## Replication Study Complete

I have completed the replication study for the Function Vectors repository. All required outputs have been created in `/net/scratch2/smallyan/function_vectors_eval/evaluation/replications/`:

### Output Files

1. **`replication.ipynb`** - Jupyter notebook containing the reimplemented experiment with:
