### Key Findings

- The repository has good documentation (plan.md, CodeWalkthrough.md, fv_demo.ipynb)
- The environment is reproducible with the provided conda environment file
- The methodology includes proper seed control for determinism
- The main challenge was GPU memory constraints requiring use of GPT-2 XL instead of GPT-J
- Function vector intervention results differed from the paper due to heuristic head selection instead of proper causal mediation analysis
